{
  "total": 467,
  "totalPage": 10,
  "page": 4,
  "pageSize": 50,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a66e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2769,
      "bookHadithIndex": 151,
      "text": "It was narrated that Salim said:\"Ibn 'Umar used to denounce stipulating conditions in Hajj, and said: 'Is not the Sunnah of the Messenger of Allah sufficient for you? If one of you is prevented from performing (finishing) Hajj let him circumambulate the House and (perform Sai) between As-Safa and al-Marwah, then exit Ihram completely until he performs Hajj the following year. And let him offer a Hadi or fast if he con not find a Hadi",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2769-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2769-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2769-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a66f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2770,
      "bookHadithIndex": 152,
      "text": "It was narrated from Salim, from his father, that:he used to denounce stipulating conditions in Hajj and said: \"Is not the Sunnah of your Prophet sufficient for you? If one of you is prevented (from completing Hajj) by anything, let him come to the House and circumambulate it, and (perform Sai) between As-Safa and Al-Marwah, then let him shave his head or cut his hair, then exit Ihram; and he has to perform Hajj the next year",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2770-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2770-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2770-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a670",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2771,
      "bookHadithIndex": 153,
      "text": "It was narrated that Al-Miswar bin Makhramah and Marwan bin Al-Hakam said:\"The Messenger of Allah went out during the time of Al-Hudabiyah with between one-thousand and three-hundred, and one-thousand and five-hundred of his Companions. Then, when they were in Dhul-Hulaifah, he garlanded and marked the Hadi and began the Talbiyah for 'Umrah (Abridged)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2771-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2771-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2771-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a671",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2772,
      "bookHadithIndex": 154,
      "text": "It was narrated from Aishah:That the Messenger of Allah marked his Budn",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2772-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2772-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2772-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a672",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2773,
      "bookHadithIndex": 155,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn Abbas:That the Prophet marked his Budn on the right side and the blood flowed down and marked it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2773-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2773-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2773-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a673",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2774,
      "bookHadithIndex": 156,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn Abbas:That when the Prophet was in Dhul-Hulaifah he ordered that his Budn be marked on the right side of its hump, then he wiped the blood on it and he garlanded it with two shoes, then when it stood up with him Al-baida; he began the Talbiyah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2774-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2774-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2774-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a674",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2775,
      "bookHadithIndex": 157,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"The Messenger of Allah used to send the Hadi from Al-Madinah, and I would twist the garlands for his Hadi, then he did not avoid anything that the person in Ihram avoids",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2775-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2775-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2775-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a675",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2776,
      "bookHadithIndex": 158,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I used to twist the garlands for the Hadi of the Messenger of Allah, then he would send them, then he would do whatever the non-Muhrim does before the Hadi reached its place (of sacrifice)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2776-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2776-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2776-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a676",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2777,
      "bookHadithIndex": 159,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I used to twist the garlands of the Hadi of the Messenger of Allah, then he would stay with his family and not enter Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2777-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2777-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2777-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a677",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2778,
      "bookHadithIndex": 160,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I used to twist the garlands of the Hadi of the Messenger of Allah, then he would garland his Hadi, then sent it, they stay (with his family) and not avoid anything that the Muhrim avoids",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2778-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2778-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2778-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a678",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2779,
      "bookHadithIndex": 161,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I remember twisting the garlands for the sheep, the Hadi of the Messenger of Allah, then he stayed as a non-Muhrim",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2779-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2779-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2779-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a679",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2780,
      "bookHadithIndex": 162,
      "text": "It was narrated from Al-Qasim that the Mother of the Believers said:\"I twisted those garlands from wool that we had, then the following morning he did what any non-Muhrim does with his wife, what any man does with his wife",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2780-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2780-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2780-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a67a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2781,
      "bookHadithIndex": 163,
      "text": "It was narrated from Hafsah, the wife of the Prophet, that she said: \"O Messenger of Allah, why is it that the people have exited Ihram for Umrah but you have not exited your Ihram for Umrah? He said: \"I have matted my hair and garlanded my Hadi, so I will not exit Ihram until I have offered the sacrifice",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2781-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2781-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2781-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a67b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2782,
      "bookHadithIndex": 164,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn Abbas:That when the Prophet of Allah came to Dhul-Hulaifah he marked the Hadi on the right side of its hump, the he removed the blood and garlanded it with two shoes, then he mounted his she-camel and when it stood up with him Al-Baida, he recited the Talbiyah and entered Ihram at noon and enter Ihram for Hajj",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2782-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2782-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2782-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a67c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2783,
      "bookHadithIndex": 165,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I twisted the garlands of the Budn of the Messenger of Allah with my own hands, then he garlanded it and marked it, and directed it toward the House and sent it. But he stayed with his family, and nothing became forbidden for him that was allowed",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2783-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2783-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2783-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a67d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2784,
      "bookHadithIndex": 166,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I twisted the garlands for the Budn of the Messenger of Allah, then he did not enter at state of Ihram or abandon any kind of regular clothing",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2784-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2784-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2784-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a67e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2785,
      "bookHadithIndex": 167,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I used to twist the garlands for the sacrificial sheep of the Messenger of Allah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2785-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2785-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2785-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a67f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2786,
      "bookHadithIndex": 168,
      "text": "It was narrated from Aishah:That the Messenger of Allah used to send sheep as a Hadi",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2786-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2786-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2786-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a680",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2787,
      "bookHadithIndex": 169,
      "text": "It was narrated from Aishah:That on one occasion the Messenger of Allah sent sheep as a Hadi and garlanded them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2787-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2787-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2787-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a681",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2788,
      "bookHadithIndex": 170,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I sued to twist the garlands of the sacrificial sheep of the Messenger of Allah. Then he did not enter a state of Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2788-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2788-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2788-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a682",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2789,
      "bookHadithIndex": 171,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I used to twist the garlands of sacrificial sheep of the Messenger of Allah. Then he did not enter a state of Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2789-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2789-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2789-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a683",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2790,
      "bookHadithIndex": 172,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"We used to garland the sheep, then the Messenger of Allah would send it, and he would not enter a state of Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2790-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2790-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2790-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a684",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2791,
      "bookHadithIndex": 173,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn Abbas:That when the Messenger of Allah came to Dhul-Huaifah he marked the Hadi on the right side of its hump, then removed the blood from it, then he garlanded it with two shoes and mounted his she-camel. When it stood up with him in Al-Baida, he began the Talbiyah for Hajj and he entered Ihram at noon",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2791-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2791-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2791-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a685",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2792,
      "bookHadithIndex": 174,
      "text": "It was narrated from Jabir:That when they were present with the Messenger of Allah in Al-Madinah, he sent the Hadi, and whoever wanted to enter Ihram did so, and whoever did not want to, did not",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2792-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2792-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2792-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a686",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2793,
      "bookHadithIndex": 175,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I used to twist the garlands for the Hadi of the Messenger of Allah with my own hands, then the Messenger of Allah would garland them with his own hand. Then he would send them with my father and the Messenger of Allah would refrain from anything that Allah, the Might and sublime, has permitted until the Hadi was sacrificed",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2793-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2793-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2793-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a687",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2794,
      "bookHadithIndex": 176,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I used to twist the garlands for the Hadi of the Messenger of Allah. Then he would not avoid anything that the Muhrim avoids",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2794-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2794-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2794-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a688",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2795,
      "bookHadithIndex": 177,
      "text": "Aishah said:\"I used to twist the garlands for the Hadi of the Messenger of Allah. Then he would not avoid anything.\" She said \"We do not know that the pilgrim may exit Ihram fully except by performing Tawaf",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2795-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2795-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2795-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a689",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2796,
      "bookHadithIndex": 178,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I used to twist the garlands fro the Hadi of the Messenger of Allah and the Hadi would be taken out garlanded, and the Messenger of Allah would stay (with his family) his wives",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2796-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2796-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2796-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a68a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2797,
      "bookHadithIndex": 179,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I remember twisting the garlands for the sacrificial sheep of the Messenger of Allah, then he sent them and stayed with us as a non-Muhrim (not in a state of Ihram)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2797-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2797-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2797-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a68b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2798,
      "bookHadithIndex": 180,
      "text": "It was narrated that Jabir said:That the Prophet drove a Hadi during his Hajj",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2798-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2798-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2798-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a68c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2799,
      "bookHadithIndex": 181,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:the Messenger of Allah saw a man driving a Badanah (Sacrificial camel) and said: \"Ride it.\" He said: \"O Messenger of Allah, it is a Badanah.\" He said: \"Ride it, woe to you!\" the second or third time",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2799-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2799-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2799-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a68d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2800,
      "bookHadithIndex": 182,
      "text": "It was narrated from Anas that:the Messenger of Allah saw a man driving a Badanah and said: \"Ride it.\" He said: \"It is Badanah.\" He said: \"Ride it.\" He said: \"It is a Badanah.\" The fourth time he said: Ride it, woe to you",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2800-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2800-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2800-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a68e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2801,
      "bookHadithIndex": 183,
      "text": "It was narrated from Anas that the Prophet saw a man driving a Badanah and he was exhausted from walking. He said:\"Ride it.\" He said: \"It \"It is Badanah.\" He said: \"Ride it even if it is a Badanah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2801-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2801-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2801-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a68f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2802,
      "bookHadithIndex": 184,
      "text": "Abu Az-Zuhair said:\"I heard Jabir bin Abdullah being asked about riding a Badanah. He said about riding a Badanah. He said: \"I heard the Messenger of Allah say: Ride it in a reasonable manner if necessary, until you find another mount",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2802-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2802-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2802-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a690",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2803,
      "bookHadithIndex": 185,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"We went out with the Messenger of Allah not thinking of anything but Hajj. When we came to Makkah we circumambulated the house, then the Messenger of Allah told those who have not brought a Hadi to exit Ihram. So those who have not brought a Hadi exited Ihram. His wives had not brought a HIad so They exited Ihram too.\" Aishah said: \"My menses came so I did not circumambulate the Hous. On the night of Al-Hasbab (the twelfth night of Dhul-Hajjah) I said\" \"O Messenger of Allah, the people are going back having done Umrah and Hajj, But I am going back having done only Hajj. He said: 'Did you not perform Tawaf when we came to Makkah?' I said: 'No.' He said: 'Then go with your brother to At-Tanim and enter Ihram for Umrah then we will meet you and such and such a place",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2803-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2803-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2803-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a691",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2804,
      "bookHadithIndex": 186,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"We went out with the Messenger of Allah not thinking of anything but Hajj. When we drew close to Makkah, the Messenger of Allah ordered: 'Whoever has a Hadi with him should remain in Ihram, and whoever does not have a Hadi with him, he should exit Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2804-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2804-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2804-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a692",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2805,
      "bookHadithIndex": 187,
      "text": "It was narrated that Jabir said:\"We, the Companions of the Prophet, entered Ihram for Hajj only, and nothing else. We came to Makkah on the morning of the fourth of Dhul-Hajjah, and the Prophet commanded us: \"Exit Ihram and make it Umrah. He heard that we were saying: 'when there are only five days between us and 'Arafat he commands us to exit Ihram and we will go out to Mina with our male members dripping with semen (because of recent intimacy with our wives)?' the Prophet stood up and addressed us, saying: 'I have heard what you said. I am the most righteous and the most pious of you, and were it not for the Hadi I would have exited Ihram. If I had known what I know now, I would not have from Yemen and he said: 'for what did you enter Ihram?' He said: 'For that for which the Messenger of Allah entered Ihram.' Suraq bin Malik bin Jushum said: 'O Messenger of Allah, do you think that this Umrah of ours is for this year only or for all time?' He said: 'It is for all time",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2805-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2805-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2805-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a693",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2806,
      "bookHadithIndex": 188,
      "text": "It was narrated from Surqah bin Malik bin Jushum said :\"O Messenger of Allah, do you think that this Umrah of ours is for this year only, or for all time?\" The Messenger of Allah said: \"It is for all time",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2806-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2806-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2806-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a694",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2807,
      "bookHadithIndex": 189,
      "text": "Surqah said:'The Messenger of Allah joined Hajj and Umrah and we did so with him. We said: \"Is it just for us, or for all time?\" He said: \"No, it is for all time",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2807-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2807-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2807-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a695",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2808,
      "bookHadithIndex": 190,
      "text": "It was narrated from Al-Harith bin Bilal that his father said:\"I said: 'O Messenger of Allah, is this annulment of Hajj just for us or is it for all the people?' He said: 'No, it is just for us.\" (Daif)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2808-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2808-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2808-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a696",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2809,
      "bookHadithIndex": 191,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Dharr said concerning Tamattu\" in Hajj:it was only for us",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2809-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2809-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2809-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a697",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2810,
      "bookHadithIndex": 192,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Dharr said concerning Tamattu' in Hajj:it is not for you, and you have nothing to do with it; it was only for us, the Companions of Muhammad",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2810-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2810-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2810-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a698",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2811,
      "bookHadithIndex": 193,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Dharr said:Tamattu was just for us",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2811-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2811-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2811-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a699",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2812,
      "bookHadithIndex": 194,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Ash-Shatha Said:\"I was with Ibrahm An-Nakha'i and Ibrahim At-taimi, and I said: 'I wanted to combine Hajj and 'Umrah this year,' but Ibrahim said: 'If you father were alive, he would not do that.' And Ibrahim At-Taimi said, (narrating) from his father, that Abu Dharr said: 'Tamattu' was only for us\". (Sahib)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2812-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2812-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2812-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a69a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2813,
      "bookHadithIndex": 195,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn Abbas said:\"They used to think that performing 'Umrah during the months of Hajj was one of the worst of evil actions on Earth, and they used to call Muharram 'Safar,' and say: 'When the sore on the backs of the camels have healed and when their hair grows back and when Safar is over' - or he said: 'When Safar beings - then 'Umrah becomes permissible for whoever wants to do it.' Then the Prophet and his companions came on the morning of the fourth of Dhul-Hijjah, reciting the Talbiyah for Hajj, He told them to make it 'Umrah, and they found it too difficult to do that. They said: 'O Messenger of Allah, to what degree should we exit Ihram?' He said: 'Completely",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2813-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2813-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2813-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a69b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2814,
      "bookHadithIndex": 196,
      "text": "Ibn Abbas said:\"The Messenger of Allah enter Ihram for 'Umrah and his companions enter Ihrahm for Hajj. He told those who did not have a Hadi with them to exit Ihram. Among those who did not have a Hadi with them was Tallah bin 'Ubaidullah and another man, so they exited Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2814-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2814-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2814-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a69c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2815,
      "bookHadithIndex": 197,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn Abbas that the Prophet said:This is 'Umrah that we have benefited from. Whoever does not have a Hadi with him, let him exit Ihram completely. Now 'Umrah is permissible during the months of Hajj",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2815-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2815-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2815-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a69d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2816,
      "bookHadithIndex": 198,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Qatadah that:he was with Messenger of Allah. When they were partway to Makkah, he lagged behind with some companions of his whowere in Ihram, but he was not in Ihram. He saw an onager, so he mounted his horse, then he asked his companions to hand him his whip, but they refused. He asked them to hand him his spear, but they refused. He took it, then chased the onager and killed it. Some of the Companions of the Messenger of Allah ate from it but others refused. The caught up with the Messenger of Allah and asked him about that, and he said: \"That is food that Allah, the Might and Sublime, gave to you",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2816-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2816-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2816-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a69e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2817,
      "bookHadithIndex": 199,
      "text": "It was narrated from Mu'adh bin Abdur-Rahman At-Taimi that his father said:\"we were with Talhah bin Ubaidullah and we were Ihram. A birth was given to him when he was asleep, and some of us at from it and others refrained. Talhah woke up and agreed with those who had eaten it, and said: 'We ate it with Messenger of Allah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2817-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2817-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2817-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a69f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2818,
      "bookHadithIndex": 200,
      "text": "It was narrated from Al-Bahzi that:the Messenger of Allah set out for Makkah and was in Ihram. When they were in Ar-Rawha, they saw a wounded onager. Mention of that was made to the messenger of Allah and he said: \"Leave it, for soon its owner will come.\" Then Al-Bahzi, who was its owner, came to the Messenger of Allah, it is up to you what you want to do with this onager.\" The Messenger of Allah Commanded Abu Bakr to share it out among the company then he moved on, and when he was in Al-Uthayah, between Ar-Ruwaythah and Al-Arj, They was a gazelle sleeping in the Shade with an arrow in it. It was said that the Messenger of Allah told a man to stand by it and not let anyone disturb it until everyone had passed by",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2818-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2818-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2818-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}